<title>INDIA: India end-June forward liabilities $17.99 bln - RBI.</title>
<headline>India end-June forward liabilities $17.99 bln - RBI.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The outstanding forward liabilities which peaked at $23.16 billion at the end of February 1996 fell to $17.99 billion by the end of June 1996, the Reserve Bank of India said in its annual report for 1995/96 (July-June) on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
